{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cc02df643495dcb9f93ee536133a48d4eac939bb81493aa9c222a213e3f60ba5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37ce4e5d91be60e2e99541c5668c39a563c245183f107db2c86676564f2924ad",
      "text": "啊！喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n在这之后你有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1181f5a12f97f02cd6300e2158d8ec2695fd0e8cc72dac4b120a28d22927591c",
      "text": "是急事吗？\n我马上确认！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1770ab4922172b34c6d5143419e024341b201fe8df88dfb90573ef2247e281d2",
      "text": "是的！有空哦\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e14d371e8e74d51501c72727b5fd46a5adcb2146ef32d7f7bf516e90e9b837c",
      "text": "啊，让你误会了吗？对不起！\n其实是想邀请你啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b76f322cdd79e5b79f18fef8d5efe6a9283a9e3aa3162a09ebca4062b8441e8f",
      "text": "想邀请●●●●プロデューサー\n来Cafe Parade！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e8ef80abd0de6551696ddbd9b6d2c20fa7bf548ec4898c3244da327cb258d47",
      "text": "其实呢，庄一郎配合节分\n做了新款蛋糕哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02d3fe6d0a0d9806414a2b6aa0133b843f26f73c6c42b45bdd376da542771e98",
      "text": "节分当天我们因为有工作错过了，\n所以他说要重新办一场品尝会♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3688db9b04c8bd780f1630751579f90a86756edae854a7601566713c5b8ad651",
      "text": "要是能把一起拍摄的大家也都叫来，\n就像小型庆功宴一样，感觉超好玩～！对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3189eb402ee590ee5e490adcc6c24fcd390b4e090d21256eef418c2a72462d21",
      "text": "所以我现在正在问制作人呢！\n怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89aaf5eb185fa05902429ae83de1bbfb154af6023ac80aa17d9f104fa627ef80",
      "text": "能来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ae9b8d0afea0c212c3b11807751e2f0291b5c864648221a6f6445b788c0b821",
      "text": "我一定去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ebf846323b47542f6987c706dfae46bd5874446cb54abb24e1e1a193ac4df05",
      "text": "太好啦——！那我也去告诉大家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:031sak_401_2_4_031_01_09_b:2_4_031_01_09_b:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efbde92eeba33e52ed9a042ef7248c5353b1ecbb951d247c8c31b46eb3fa423e",
      "text": "那么，我们会准备好超可爱的蛋糕和红茶，\n等着●●●●プロデューサー过来哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
